+منبع انگلیسی:
+```latex
+Clearly $\overline{s}$ is an infinite sequence of $0$'s and
+
+$1$'s, since it is just the mirror sequence to the sequence of $0$'s
+
+and $1$'s that appear on the diagonal of our array.  So $\overline{s}$
+
